// Configuration settings file for Shunik — Release / production.
// API base URL is injected via Info.plist so runtime code can read it.

// xcconfig treats `//` as a comment, so we break it with an empty variable.
// The $(EMPTY) reference expands to nothing, resulting in
// https://shunik-api.antonkosenko.pro (the Cloudflare-fronted origin).
EMPTY =
API_BASE_URL = https:/$(EMPTY)/shunik-api.antonkosenko.pro

// Sentry DSN (observability Stage 0): empty = crash reporting disabled.
// Self-reference resolves from the environment, so Xcode Cloud workflow env
// vars flow in; unset expands to empty (a build with an empty DSN ships
// with the SDK disabled). CI also overrides on the xcodebuild command line.
SENTRY_DSN = $(SENTRY_DSN)